    "text": "FOX43.com\nwebsite\nPhiladelphia\nPhiladelphia Zoo welcomes two new endangered big cats\n1 days ago\nPHILADELPHIA — The Philadelphia Zoo on Tuesday announced the arrival of its two newest residents — a female Amur tiger named Rory, and a male Amur leopard named Rafferty. Both animals arrived at the zoo earlier this summer and can be viewed in their habitats at Big Cat Falls, the zoo said.\n139",
